    "Sun-3":  "The part of you that needs to claim space is anchored in the small daily courage of love — brief words, quick stands, the small visible moves of bond. Show up consistently in the small things; the larger visibility builds from there. The steady you is the one being seen.",
    "Sun-4":  "The part of you that needs to be seen is anchored in home and inner ground in love. The bond keeps asking you to be visible from the rooted self, not the performed one. People recognize the difference; let the home version of you walk in. The version that lasts is the rooted one.",
