    "Sun-8":  "The part of you that needs to be seen is anchored in shared depths. Visibility in love here is hard-earned through long change, hidden work that eventually shows. Trust the slow climb. The bond you become through deep work is more honest than any quick one.",
    "Sun-9":  "The part of you that needs to claim space is anchored in meaning and what you believe about love. The bond keeps pulling toward visibility through conviction, the long-arc reasons. Speak the why; people remember love that has a why even when they forget the what.",
    "Sun-10": "The part of you that needs to be seen is anchored directly in the public face of the bond. There is no separation here between identity and visibility. Carry the relationship with quiet pride; you have earned the visibility, and you do not need to earn it again every morning.",
